        },
        {
          "text": "Inni aka qaalole gugurdo taani injiru ta guyya ch'ufa sorio qaltu, qara maro daba ufitiifi, ammalle maro daba namale. Inni sorio toko baase, taka quba ch'alla, gaafa nafa ufi baase. ",
          "type": "text",
